          "size": 20,
          "color": "#C00000"
        },
        {
          "kind": "text",
          "text": "VIPSeg objects: FID 41 vs 61 (SG-I2V) / 85 (MotionClone); mIoU 0.75 vs 0.63 / 0.71",
          "rect": [
            30,
